  decided by the M3 eval, not by this file.

  Translation rules (must hold in every language version):
  - The model still RETURNS English tokens: category values (Crop, Livestock,
    Weather, Market, Scheme, Facility), interaction values (advise, observe,
    act), field names (subject_categories, interaction_type,
    agriculture_subjects, place_name, place_from_history), null/true, and
